<title>CHINA: Shanghai Narcissus appoints chairman.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Narcissus appoints chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Narcissus Electric Appliances Co Ltd has appointed Song Weimin as chairman of its board of directors, a company statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>The appointment was approved by a recent shareholders' meeting, the statement in the Shanghai Securities News said.</p>
<p>The former chairman Xu Hanxing had moved on to another job, the statement said but gave no further details.</p>
</text>
